---
layout: base.njk
title: News
description: Updates, talks, service, and milestones.
---
<h1>News</h1>
<p>Short updates in reverse chronological order. Replace sample entries in <code>src/_data/news.json</code>.</p>

<ul class="news-list">
  {% for item in news | sortNews %}
  <li class="news-item" id="news-{{ item.date }}">
    <time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.date }}</time>
    <h3 class="news-title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
    {% if item.summary %}<p class="news-summary">{{ item.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if item.body %}<p>{{ item.body }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if item.href %}<p><a href="{{ item.href }}">More →</a></p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
